            <description><![CDATA[<p>A quick follow-up to v0.5.0: the per-turn cost breakdown now shows
every turn.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>The turn breakdown no longer caps at 12.</strong> Expanding
a conversation row listed only the 12 most recent turns and rolled the
rest into an “N earlier turns” summary line. It now shows every turn in
the conversation, newest first, with no collapse.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
